<h1 class="text-lg font-semibold">
  👋 Hello there ...
</h1>
<article class="space-y-4">
  <span>
    <!--
    <p>
      <Callout type="construction">
        Under construction: fasten your seatbelts💺<br>
        Things might suddenly break 💔 or change 🔃 during updates.
      </Callout>
    </p>
    -->
    <p>
      This site will mostly be focused on tech/geek/gadget/programming stuff.
    </p>
    <p>
      I will also share my applications/projects on this page.<br>
      Feel free to have a look at the 
      <Link href="/projects">
        projects
      </Link> section or read through the
      <Link href="/blog">
        blog
      </Link> where I will announce project updates and write about other (tech) topics.
    </p>
    <p>
      My blog posts are written in English ( <span class="fi fi-us"></span> ) and/or Dutch ( <span class="fi fi-nl"></span> ).
    </p>
    <p>
      All my blog posts (comments excluded) are migrated to this
      <Link external href="https://astro.build">
        Astro
      </Link> 🚀 static-site.<br>
      The current theme for this page is the minimalistic
      <Link external href="https://astro-micro.vercel.app">
        Astro Micro
      </Link> 🔬
